Constructor

:param extent: in real world coordinate coordinates
:param XCellCount: 
:param XCellSize: size of the cell in X direction, can be negative
:param YCellSize: size of the cell in X direction, can be negative

If cell size is negative, the row or column index will increase when
real world coordinate decreases. So, if YCellSize < 0 and XCellSize>0,
then the origin of the grid raster (0,0) will be at (Xmin,Ymax) of
extent.
%End
